## Files with different licenses

This license covers the Ansible collection. The rest of the rocm-ernic
repository mixes MIT and GPL code, including the emulator under `src/`,
which is `GPL-2.0-or-later`; see `LICENSE.md` at the top of the repository.

The per-file SPDX header takes precedence for any file that contains one.
